classDiagram
    note for AdapterRegistry "编译期保证 Agent ID 唯一；刷新当前命令的已支持且已安装 Agent 快照，并按 Agent × Power 类别解析适配器"
    class AdapterRegistry {
        <<interface>>
        +Resolve(AgentID, PowerType) (Adapter, error)
        +RefreshInstalled() (AgentSnapshot, error)
    }

    note for Adapter "安装检测只检查 Agent 根目录存在且为目录，不检查目录是否为空；不负责 Agent 安装、卸载、实时监控或运行时感知"
    class Adapter {
        <<interface>>
        +DetectAgent() (bool, error)
        +InstallPath(AgentID) string
        +Install(Power, dest string) error
        +Uninstall(Power) error
    }

    note for AgentSnapshot "当前命令内不可变且不持久化的已支持且已安装 Agent 列表"
    class AgentSnapshot {
        +Agents []AgentID
        +Contains(AgentID) bool
        +Ordered() []AgentID
    }

    note for adapterRegistry "编译期 Registry 以唯一 Agent ID 收录内置 Adapter；运行时直接按 Agent ID 升序刷新，不再去重"
    class adapterRegistry {
        +Resolve(AgentID, PowerType) (Adapter, error)
        +RefreshInstalled() (AgentSnapshot, error)
    }

    note for hermesAdapter "适配 Hermes：按其目录约定写入 Power"
    class hermesAdapter {
        +DetectAgent() (bool, error)
        +InstallPath(AgentID) string
        +Install(Power, dest string) error
        +Uninstall(Power) error
    }

    note for codexAdapter "适配 Codex：按其目录约定与格式写入 Power"
    class codexAdapter {
        +DetectAgent() (bool, error)
        +InstallPath(AgentID) string
        +Install(Power, dest string) error
        +Uninstall(Power) error
    }

    note for claudeCodeAdapter "适配 Claude Code：按其 Power 目录与格式写入内容"
    class claudeCodeAdapter {
        +DetectAgent() (bool, error)
        +InstallPath(AgentID) string
        +Install(Power, dest string) error
        +Uninstall(Power) error
    }

    adapterRegistry ..|> AdapterRegistry
    adapterRegistry --> Adapter : resolves
    AdapterRegistry --> AgentSnapshot : refreshes
    hermesAdapter ..|> Adapter
    codexAdapter ..|> Adapter
    claudeCodeAdapter ..|> Adapter
